.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Represents a shared memory bridge between a \fBDeviceBuffer\fP and a hardware‑specific backend implementing \fBIDeviceSharedBackend\fP\&. 
.br
 Manages the lifecycle of a hardware buffer, including creation, upload, download, and cleanup, depending on the configured \fBSharedCacheType\fP\&. 


